2026-03-30 17:57:19,392 | ERROR | Error in main: Changing param values is not allowed. Param with key='error_type' was already logged with value='str' for run ID='de0fcea4584f4be9a7a7a35713da2a5f'. Attempted logging new value 'ValueError'.

The cause of this error is typically due to repeated calls
to an individual run_id event logging.

Incorrect Example:
---------------------------------------
with mlflow.start_run():
    mlflow.log_param("depth", 3)
    mlflow.log_param("depth", 5)
---------------------------------------

Which will throw an MlflowException for overwriting a
logged parameter.

Correct Example:
---------------------------------------
with mlflow.start_run():
    with mlflow.start_run(nested=True):
        mlflow.log_param("depth", 3)
    with mlflow.start_run(nested=True):
        mlflow.log_param("depth", 5)
---------------------------------------

Which will create a new nested run for each individual
model and prevent parameter key collisions within the
tracking store.
